  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c5b6b095-fc55-4c89-8145-575a820ed753",
      "name": "Sticky Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -256,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 564,
        "height": 740,
        "content": "## AI email auto-responder\n\nLet AI answer your inbox, but **nothing reaches a customer until you\napprove it** from any device.\n\nTwo branches, one automation, joined through Tracira (not by a wire).\nActivate the workflow once and both run.\n\n### How it works\n- **Draft branch:** every new Gmail message is flattened into clean\n  fields (sender, subject, body), an AI model drafts a reply, and\n  Send to Tracira logs the draft. Nothing is sent yet.\n- **Send branch:** when you approve the draft in Tracira, the Tracira\n  Trigger fires and Gmail sends the approved reply. Fix the wording\n  first and it sends your version instead. Reject it and nothing goes\n  out.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a free account at [tracira.com](https://tracira.com/?utm_source=n8n&utm_medium=template&utm_campaign=ai-email-auto-responder) if you don't have one yet.\n2. In n8n, search the nodes panel for **Tracira** and add it.\n3. Connect your **Gmail**, **OpenAI**, and **Tracira** credentials.\n4. Open **Send to Tracira** and set your workspace and task name.\n5. Activate the workflow, then approve or reject each draft in Tracira.\n\n### Customization tips\n- Narrow the **Filter** node to certain senders or labels.\n- Edit the prompt in **Draft a reply** to match your tone."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "974bde41-6370-4a1c-afd7-99325d352928",
      "name": "Sticky Note A",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1072,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 636,
        "height": 484,
        "content": "### 2. Draft a reply with AI\n\nAI drafts a reply, then **Send to Tracira** holds it for review.\nNothing is sent: the draft waits in Tracira for a human."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e576baf1-6704-41e2-b507-af10cf7be84b",
      "name": "Sticky Note B",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        416,
        864
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 760,
        "height": 484,
        "content": "### 3. Send once a human approves\n\nFires the moment someone approves in Tracira, whether they approved the AI's reply or rewrote it first.\nThe text and its recipient come directly from Tracira, so this branch just sends it. Reject it and nothing goes out."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
